  "2026-11-04: the 53 synthsys items are dropped; the bank is the 47 selfdescribe items of items.json, verbatim and in the same order. A synthsys item states its attribute verbatim in the system prompt (built as the verbatim-echo floor), so under the echo rule it rewarded only rewording or invented detail (um-ss-continent-00: 'Since you're in South Africa' for a prompt that says 'Africa'); it was half of the headline (synthsys .42-.47 vs selfdescribe .91-1.00).",
  "read_plan_bank = items.json: the read plan stays items.json's 100 rows (one read, one plan_sha), so existing readouts judge this bank with no GPU; the judge loads only these 47 ids. Option lists are per item (seeded by name), so every kept item shows the same options as under items.json.",
  "floors (lucky guessing, prompt-only) and the ATI subset were measured on the 100-item bank and must be recomputed on this one."
 ],
